                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It slows down like an old nintendo game, you die when you hit bottom of the screen like an old NES game too. It sounds like a NES game, it has enemies that appear and knock you back 20 feet like a NES game, there are powerups that are impossible to reach they are just there to tease you like any old NES game would have. This emulates all the flaws of an old NES game. It is a very hard game and very annoying to play, but it also feels good to play it like any old NES game haha. If you still like NES games in 2015 then this is the game for you. If you hate old games then stay away simple as that.",
